    skos:example "Applicability — EV: x; LMT: x; Other Industrial >2kWh: x; Stationary >2kWh: x" .

dpp:preConsumerRecycledNickelShare
    a owl:DatatypeProperty, skos:Concept ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy dpp: ;
    rdfs:domain dpp:CircularityAndResourceEfficiency_RecycledAndRenewableContent ;
    rdfs:range xsd:decimal ;
    rdfs:label "Pre-consumer recycled nickel share"@en ;
    skos:prefLabel "Pre-consumer recycled nickel share"@en ;
    skos:inScheme dpp:CircularityAndResourceEfficiency ;
    dct:identifier "48" ;
    skos:definition "The share of nickel recycled from pre-consumer waste in the active materials of the battery"@en ;
    skos:scopeNote """A battery passport must include recycled content information.

The content information must include the percentage share of nickel that is present in active materials and that has been recovered from battery manufacturing waste, for each battery model per year and per manufacturing plant.

Pre-consumer waste or “battery manufacturing waste” is “the materials or objects rejected during the battery manufacturing process, which cannot be re-used as an integral part in the same process and need to be recycled”"""@en ;
    skos:note "The recycled content shares from pre-consumer waste and post-consumer waste of cobalt, lithium, nickel in active materials and lead present in the battery should be calculated and declared separately."@en ;
    dpp:regulationReference "Annex XIII (1e); Art. 8(1), Art. 3, 1(51)" ;
    dct:relation "DIN DKE Spec 99100 6.6.2.3" ;
    dpp:unit "%" ;
    dpp:dataFormat "Decimal" ;
    dpp:accessRights dpp:Public ;
    dpp:dataBehaviour dpp:Static ;
    dpp:granularityLevel dpp:BatteryModelPerCalendarYearAndManufacturingSite ;
    dpp:granularityLevelDetail "Pack: x" ;
    dpp:applicableTo dpp:ElectricVehicleBattery, dpp:LightMeansOfTransportBattery, dpp:OtherIndustrialBatteryAbove2kWh, dpp:StationaryIndustrialBatteryAbove2kWh ;
    skos:example "Applicability — EV: x; LMT: x; Other Industrial >2kWh: x; Stationary >2kWh: x" .

